# Fixtures on which vera-next's native codegen disagrees with its own
# interpreter: every .v fixture's --emit-exe binary run with its native step
# and with the interpreter alone (VERA_INTERPRET=1), byte for byte
# (`zig build diff-native`, tests/differential/comp.zig with v_options). One
# line each: the fixture path under tests/conformance/tests, its owner, then
# the first difference.
# A listed fixture that agrees fails the run until its line goes. Refresh:
# -Dcomp-rebaseline writes zig-out/native.xfail.new.
